{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"d15fb410b626656d3109e7d39d40bb8b22d9a88573d44e90587f90d4f85f91c5","digest":{"component_or_area":"Gerrit project configuration and submit workflow","key_entities":["infra/gerrit/project.config","[submit] action","Autosubmit label","label-Autosubmit ACL","rebase-on-behalf grant","Verified copyCondition","refs/meta/config","infra/gerrit/setup-project.sh","submit_type=REBASE_IF_NECESSARY"],"problem_keywords":["gerrit","submit type","rebase if necessary","autosubmit","label retirement","acl","cutover","production migration"],"propositions":["Change Gerrit project submit type from FAST_FORWARD_ONLY to REBASE_IF_NECESSARY in infra/gerrit/project.config and retire the Autosubmit label definition and associated ACL grants.","Verify that Verified+1 and LLM-Review+1 copyCondition still gates change submission correctly under the new Rebase-If-Necessary submit type.","Update infra/gerrit/setup-project.sh and smoke-check scripts to remove references to the retired Autosubmit label and rebase-on-behalf ACL.","Apply the refs/meta/config change via admin key in a production quiet window with a dry-run diff validated beforehand, and confirm live submit type is REBASE_IF_NECESSARY and Autosubmit label is absent.","Verify Gerrit's built-in server-side rebase behavior works correctly: behind-tip changes rebase automatically on submit, tip changes fast-forward, and textual conflicts are rejected with a rebase-manually signal."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785817692859525734,"uuid":"46d58518-a8d1-4a9f-a4ea-25aa64acbe4d"}